                                "example_id": "450588c7-f152-4015-91ae-1c6af518c3e6",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "Starts ooking and eeking About Slavery, Racism, Hair Salons, etc!",
                                "translation": "开始胡扯些什么奴隶制、种族主义、美发沙龙之类的！"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "218cd484-4431-4cf6-a9a0-3968dd5ea6c7",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "On Saturday, April 27, 2013 11:40:40 PM UTC+10, nigger brndy ooked:\n> You all have AIDS, cock suckers.",
                                "translation": "2013年4月27日星期六，下午11:40:40 UTC+10，Brandy这个黑鬼叫道：\n>你们都得了艾滋，傻逼们。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d11c9a64-a646-40d8-aab0-83a229f835d8",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "Weird spectacle, to be expected of simians.\nThe grieving mudda is wearing dark sunglasses even though it is night\nand appears highly medicated, she ooks and eeks and you can tell she is\nin her glory in front of the cameras."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ee2e552-586d-4f03-ac72-07a726bfd29c",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "Meanwhile, the first nigger interviewed on the scene said she saw\nthe whole thing. She ooked that the \"boy\" dint do nuffins\" .",
                                "translation": "与此同时，现场接受采访的第一个女黑鬼表示，她目睹了整个过程。她说那“小子”“什么也没做”。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "403393be-05a9-4d1d-922e-41f5c0555172",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "WASHINGTON -- A California coongressboon ooked today that it would be\n\"preparing the nigger resistance\" instead of apetending human\nPresident-elect Trump's inauguration.\nRep. Barbara Lee (D/Nigger-Calif.) ooked its chimpout in a statement:\n\"I will not be celebrating or honoring an incoming president who rode\nracism, sexism, xenophobia and bigotry to the White House.\"",
                                "translation": "华盛顿——加州一位国会议员今天表示，她将“准备黑人抵抗运动”，而不是庆祝当选总统特朗普的就职典礼。加州民主党众议员芭芭拉·李在一份声明中怒斥道：“我不会庆祝或尊敬一位靠种族主义、性别歧视、仇外心理和偏见入主白宫的总统。”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec21454-0153-4e24-8a9f-83eccd1ec288",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "Schenee started getting into chimpouts with its husboon Freddie, and at\none point ooked to it: 'The only thing you do is wipe my ass and wash\nme up'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fa0866e-4b94-44c8-a9d4-7574f3e96b34",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "Ugly disgusting jungle chimp go back to the mudaland Ápefrica u came from u ooking eeking nigger ape piece of shit",
                                "translation": "丑陋恶心的丛林黑猩猩，滚回你的老家非洲猿猴大陆去吧，你这整天乱吼的黑鬼猿猴，一坨屎。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3acebb4d-9894-43e6-84cb-2bbf5f6f7a26",
                                "sense_id": "1dd9870f-fe59-3ec6-8808-914c33246f16",
                                "text": "Castle Hill, Bronx … 51-year-old C&R nigger Gary Mallette is wanted for\nattempted muhdik on an 83-year-old female in her apartment. The nigger\nposed as a repair-nig and ooked it was going to fix a leak.",
                                "translation": "布朗克斯区卡斯尔山……51岁的黑鬼加里·马莱特因涉嫌在一名83岁老妇的公寓内企图强奸她而被通缉。这黑鬼伪装成维修工，谎称要来修漏水。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
